{
  "_comment": "Only for what a player types that nothing else understands (Lines.loosely): typos are put right on their own, then these are tried. 'fillers' are words left out ('u got ANY food PLS' is 'u got food'). 'same' are groups of words that mean the same here: each is tried in the others' place ('do u carry food' is tried as 'do u have food'). One word on the left of a group's entries works best; the others can be two words. Never a word with another meaning that matters (no 'like': 'do you like me').",
